<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-MCKENZIE MISSES WELSH GAME.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-MCKENZIE MISSES WELSH GAME.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Injury has forced Scotland hooker Kevin McKenzie out of Saturday's opening Five Nations match against Wales</p>
<p>McKenzie has developed a disc problem in his neck, allowing Graham Ellis of Currie to win his first cap.</p>
<p>Gregor Townsend, injured in training on Wednesday, took part in a full squad session on Thursday.</p>
